Shift_candidate_alpha already dispatch_ready true.

Shift_candidate_beta needs to become dispatch_ready after we finalize etc. There are two ways to get dispatch_ready: finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation or finalize_candidate_after_sequence_validation or finalize_candidate_direct. Those give dispatch_ready as effect. Also mark_origin/destination dispatch ready actions.

